content.text:
Confirmed — the `{{token_ref}}` variable is saved with the canonical value the live introspection route returned. I hit `GET /v3/agencies/me` with the bearer session token `tk_write_5d8e` and the `X-Agency-Id: MTC-ATL` context header; the server echoed back `token_ref` (and confirmed the token's effective scopes are `feeds:read` and `alerts:write` for agency `MTC-ATL`). I persisted that echoed value into `{{token_ref}}` rather than assuming it.

```json
{
  "token_ref": "tk_write_5d8e"
}
```
